.TH DNAREN 1 "VERSION" "dnaren manual"
.SH NAME
dnaren - minimal DNA renderer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dnaren
.RB [ -v ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
dnaren renders a right-handed DNA double helix using X11 and OpenGL, with
major and minor groove, backbones, and base pairs colored by base (A-T, G-C)
joined by hydrogen bonds. Window title shows speed, pause state, and palette.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -v
Print version and exit.
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
ESC, q
Quit.
.TP
Space
Pause rotation.
.TP
+, -
Increase or decrease rotation speed (main and keypad).
.TP
0
Reset speed (main and keypad).
.TP
Arrow keys, WASD
Rotate camera.
.TP
z, x
Zoom in and out.
.TP
r
Reset camera.
.TP
c
Cycle color scheme.
.TP
f, F11
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
Mouse drag
Rotate camera (auto-rotation pauses while button held).
.TP
Mouse wheel
Zoom in and out.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR glx (3)